  "description": "Yalla!! V2 Fox Factory Complete Bike\nThis complete bike ships with the new FOX 40 MY27 fork. The pictures still show the build with the previous FOX 40.\nThe Yalla! is our answer to riders who want it all: proven performance, more versatility, and that unmistakable Yalla! feeling. Born on the legendary slopes of Champéry and refined through countless laps on race tracks and bike parks alike, the V2 builds on everything we loved about the original—just better. We kept the trusted geometry and suspension kinematics but added new features like adjustable, UDH-compatible dropouts and the option to run 29” or MX setups. Whether you’re chasing podiums or weekend thrills, the Yalla! is built to go fast, take hits, and keep going—again and again.\nThe build on this Yalla! reflects exactly where we set our own priorities. Fox or Öhlins suspension, tuned to perfectly match the kinematics, Sram brakes and drivetrain—either mechanical or wireless—and durable wheels from DT Swiss. Finished off with OneUp cockpit, Ergon touchpoints, and Maxxis tires. The configuration options allow for personal preference and fit, so you can grab the bike and go straight out of the box.\nTo learn more about the Yalla!, you can find all details here and if you need help with your configuration, check out the extensive buyers’ guide or get in touch with us.",
